---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Where Is Baldo?" description="Privacy Policy for whereisbaldo.com">
  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Effective Date: May 2026 · whereisbaldo.com</p>
  </div>
  <div class="post-body legal-body">

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how whereisbaldo.com ("the blog," "we," "us") collects, uses, and protects your information when you visit this site. By using this site, you agree to the terms described here.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Information you provide directly:</strong> If you contact us via email or a contact form, we collect your name and email address so we can respond to you. We don't sell this information to anyone.</p>
    <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> Like most websites, this blog uses tools that automatically collect certain data when you visit, including your IP address, browser type, pages visited, and how long you stayed. This is standard web analytics data.</p>
    <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> This site uses cookies. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for full details.</p>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors find and use the blog. Google Analytics collects anonymous data about your visit (pages viewed, time on site, general location). It does not collect your name or identify you personally.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>This site displays ads through Google AdSense. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>This blog contains affiliate links. If you click a link and make a purchase, I may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. See our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>This blog links to external websites. Once you leave whereisbaldo.com, this Privacy Policy no longer applies. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of other sites.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold about you. Contact us at <a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a> with any requests.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The effective date at the top of this page will reflect when it was last updated. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Reach us at <strong><a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></strong></p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
